<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela inflation 30 pct in 1997 - Petkoff.</title>
<headline>Venezuela inflation 30 pct in 1997 - Petkoff.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan inflation in 1997 will fall to around 30 percent from this year's 100 percent rate, Planning Minister Teodoro Petkoff said.</p>
<p>But &quot;without Venezuelan Agenda it would rise to 150 percent,&quot; he said after a meeting of economists at the Venezuelan Investment Fund (FIV).</p>
<p>Petkoff said inflation would finish this year at 100 percent, falling next year &quot;to a third of 1996.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
